{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "末即天地人物"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "習儒道者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "習佛不了義教者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上四在此篇中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此一在第三篇中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天竺世教，儀式雖殊，懲惡勸善無別，亦不離仁義等五\n常，而有德行可修例。如：此國歛手而舉，吐番散手而垂，皆為禮也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不殺是仁；不盜是義；\n不邪淫是禮；不妄語是信；不飲噉酒肉，神氣清潔益於智也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "題中不標天鬼地獄者，界地不同，見聞不及，凡俗尚不\n知末，況肯窮本？故對俗教且標原人。今敘佛經，理宜具列"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "然業有三種：\n一惡，二善，三不動。報有三時：謂現報，生報，後報"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "貪名利以榮我"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "瞋違情境恐侵害我"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非理計校"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別業所感"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "共業所感"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從空劫初成世界者，頌曰：空界大風起，傍廣數無量，厚十六洛叉，金剛不能壞。\n此名持界風。光音金藏雲，布及三千界，雨如車軸下，風遏不聽流，深十一洛叉，始作金剛界。次第金藏雲，注雨\n滿其內，先成梵王界，乃至夜摩天。風鼓清水成，須彌七金等，滓濁為山地，四洲及泥犁，鹹海外輪圍，方名器界\n立。時經一增減，乃至二禪福，盡下生人間。初食地餅林藤，後粳米不銷，大小便利，男女形別，分田立主求臣佐，\n種種差別。經十九增減，兼前總二十增減，名為成劫。議曰：空界劫中，是道教指云虛無之道，然道體寂照靈通，\n不是虛無，老氏或迷之、或權設，務絕人欲，故指空界為道。空界中大風，即彼混沌一氣，故彼云道生一也。金藏\n雲者，氣形之始，即太極也。雨下不流，陰氣凝也。陰陽相合，方能生成矣！梵王界乃至須彌者，彼之天也，滓濁\n者地，即一生二矣！二禪福盡下生，即人也。即二生三，三才備矣！地餅已下乃至種種，即三生萬物。此當三皇已\n前穴居野食，未有火化等，但以其時無文字記載故，後人傳聞不明，展轉錯謬，諸家著作種種異說。佛教又緣通明\n\n三千世界，不局大唐，故內外教文不全同也。住者住劫，亦經二十增減。壞者壞劫，亦二十增減，前十九增減壞有\n情，後一增減壞器界，能壞是火水風等三災。空者空劫，亦二十增減，中空無世界及諸有情也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道教只知今此世界未成\n時一度空劫，云虛無、混沌、一氣等，名為元始。不知空界已前，早經千千萬萬遍成住壞空，終而復始。故知佛教法中，\n小乘淺淺之教，已超外典深深之說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能領納好惡之事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能取像者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能造作者念念遷流"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能了別者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "知苦諦也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷集諦也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道諦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "滅諦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "根境等為緣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "悶絕、睡眠、滅盡定、無想定、無想天"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "重病心惛，見異色人物也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "夢想所見、可知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廣如前說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不了之義，如後所破"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "破相之談，不唯諸部般若，遍在大乘經。前之三教依次先後，此\n教隨執即破，無定時節。故龍樹立二種般若：一共，二不共。共者，二乘同聞信解，破二乘法執故。不共者，唯菩薩\n解，密顯佛性故。故天竺戒賢、智光二論師，各立三時教，指此空教，或云在唯識法相之前，或云在後。今意取後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下却將彼喻破之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如此等文徧大乘藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有餘者，餘義未了也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛了義實教"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "然佛說前五教，或漸或頓，若\n\n有中下之機，則從淺至深，漸漸誘接。先說初教，令離惡住善；次說二三，令離染住淨；後說四五，破相顯性，會\n權歸實，依實教修乃至成佛。若上上根智，則從本至末，謂初便依第五頓指一真心體，心體既顯，自覺一切皆是虛\n妄，本來空寂，但以迷故，託真而起。須以悟真之智，斷惡修善，修善息妄歸真，妄盡真圓，是名法身佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "會前所斥，同歸一源，皆為正義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初唯第五性教所說，從後段已去，節級方同諸\n教，各如注說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自此方是第四\n教，亦同破此已生滅諸相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下方是第三法相教中亦同所說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下方是第二小乘教中亦同所說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下方是第一人天教中亦同所說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下方是儒道二教亦同所說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "會彼\n所說，以氣為本"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "會彼所說，自然為本"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "會彼所說，皆由天命"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如前敘列"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即彼始自太易，五重運轉乃至太極，太極生兩儀。彼說自然大道，如此說真性，其實但是一念能\n變見分。彼云，元氣如此一念初動。其實但是境界之相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "P174n1681_p0718a02"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "P174n1681_p0718b06"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "P174n1681_p0720a07"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "P174n1681_p0722a09"}
{"id": null, "n": "0707002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0707002", "type": "mod", "text": "論【大】，論并【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0707003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0707003", "type": "mod", "text": "寺【大】，寺圭峰蘭若【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0708001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0708001", "type": "mod", "text": "於【大】，于【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0708002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0708002", "type": "mod", "text": "歘【大】＊，欻【甲】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0708003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0708003", "type": "mod", "text": "鑒【大】，鑑【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0708004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0708004", "type": "mod", "text": "此一【大】，〔－〕【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0708005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0708005", "type": "mod", "text": "常【大】，〔－〕【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0708006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0708006", "type": "mod", "text": "淫【大】，婬【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0708007", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0708007", "type": "mod", "text": "途【大】，塗【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0708008", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0708008", "type": "mod", "text": "凡【大】，風【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0708009", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0708009", "type": "mod", "text": "有【大】，者【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0709001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0709001", "type": "mod", "text": "相【大】，和【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0709002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0709002", "type": "mod", "text": "地【大】，地也【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0709003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0709003", "type": "mod", "text": "是【大】，者是【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0709004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0709004", "type": "mod", "text": "元【大】，無【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0709005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0709005", "type": "mod", "text": "大【大】，〔－〕【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0709006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0709006", "type": "mod", "text": "蘊【大】，〔－〕【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0709007", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0709007", "type": "mod", "text": "我【大】，〔－〕【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0709008", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0709008", "type": "mod", "text": "四千【大】，〔－〕【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0709009", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0709009", "type": "mod", "text": "指【大】，措【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0709010", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0709010", "type": "mod", "text": "寤【CB】【北藏-CB】【甲】，寐【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0709011", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0709011", "type": "mod", "text": "差別【大】，別差【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0709012", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0709012", "type": "mod", "text": "徧【大】，偏【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0709013", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0709013", "type": "mod", "text": "之【大】，〔－〕【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710001", "type": "mod", "text": "鏡【CB】【北藏-CB】【甲】，境【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710002", "type": "mod", "text": "依【大】，因【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710003", "type": "mod", "text": "以【大】，已【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710004", "type": "mod", "text": "相【大】，想【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710005", "type": "mod", "text": "返【大】，反【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710006", "type": "mod", "text": "說【大】，談【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710007", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710007", "type": "mod", "text": "本【CB】【北藏-CB】【甲】，令【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710008", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710008", "type": "mod", "text": "知【大】，之【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710009", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710009", "type": "mod", "text": "所【大】，此【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710010", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710010", "type": "mod", "text": "此【大】，此之【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710011", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710011", "type": "mod", "text": "於【大】，〔－〕【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710012", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710012", "type": "mod", "text": "同【大】，因【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710013", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710013", "type": "mod", "text": "不知【大】，〔－〕【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710014", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710014", "type": "mod", "text": "大【CB】【北藏-CB】【甲】，太【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710015", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710015", "type": "mod", "text": "識和【大】，〔－〕【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710016", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710016", "type": "mod", "text": "成【大】，是【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710017", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710017", "type": "mod", "text": "返【大】，反【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0710018", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0710018", "type": "mod", "text": "身【大】，身自然【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0707001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0707001", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】增上寺報恩藏明本，【甲】慶應元年刊宗教大學藏本"}
{"id": null, "n": "0707002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0707002", "type": "orig", "text": "論＋（并）【甲】"}
